# Test Coverage Targets
RULE: 70% minimum (blocking), 80% recommended (production), 80% goal (audit readiness).
WHY: Quality gates block merge below 70%; production and audits need 80%.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/testing.md, .cursor/rules/test-quality-standards.mdc
DO: Focus on core logic for 70%; add edge cases for 80%; complete paths for audit readiness
NEVER: Skip tests to pass gates; exclude test paths from coverage; target <70%
